# Extracted installs never belong in the repo; only the source zip is tracked.
#
# nvim-portable-tools/ is listed separately because "nvim-portable/" does not
# match it -- a gap that let 1,200 extracted tool files get committed when a
# mistyped `--Update` caused setup.ps1 to install into the repo directory.
# setup.ps1 now rejects stray positional arguments, but keep both patterns.
nvim-win64/
nvim-portable/
nvim-portable-tools/

# Any install root accidentally created inside the repo by a mistyped switch.
--*/

# Local scratch
*.log
*.tmp
